OL,3,AI'm a classic old school Conservative,
OL,4,Asays Kemi Badenoch
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Tory leader is trying to ensure her
OL,7,Fparty stands out in a crowded political
OL,8,Ffield. The Conservatives are trailing
OL,9,FLabour and Reform UK in the opinion
OL,10,Fpolls and have yet to recover from
OL,11,Ftheir historic defeat at the 2024
OL,12,Fgeneral election.
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/39
